§I THESIS
  ⟦
    Snapshot of CSSLv3 repository state @ commit-tip 2026-05-18 + indexed pointer-set for navigation by
    future-agent. CSSLv3 is a sovereign · effect-typed · capability-disciplined systems-language with a
    stage-0 Rust-hosted compiler (csslc) + 183-crate Cargo workspace · pure-CSSL stdlib (14 modules ·
    ~3232 LOC) · CSSL-native engine scaffold (6 modules · ~5278 LOC) · 70+ canonical CSL specs ·
    cross-platform GPU codegen (SPIR-V · DXIL · MSL · WGSL) + 5 host backends (D3D12 · Vulkan · Metal ·
    WebGPU · Level-Zero). Current strategic posture (per spec/55 pivot 2026-05-03 + spec/59 Grok-revenue-
    response) : conventional Forward+ rasterizer mainline @ 1440p144 on Arc A770 · substrate-rendering
    (12-stage / 6-novelty-paths per spec/32) demoted to optional effect-pass · revenue-first ordering
    per spec/59 § 7-action re-prioritization. Phase-A correctness bundle (spec/70 · 12 items) is in
    flight · item-01 (sentinel-return) IMPLEMENTED · 02/03/04/05/06/08/09/19/30/87/89 pending depth-0..3
    fanout. Critical pinned-bug : csslc cranelift-CPU backend cannot emit object-files for the 12 new
    CSSL engine files (parse-clean ✓ · type-check ✓ · MIR-lower ✓ · object-emit ✗) ; PATH-α+β parallel
    progression per spec/55 § FORWARD-PATHS recommendation.
  ⟧

