§I ARCHITECTURE-LAYERS · the-5-layer-stack
  ⟦
    L0 · OS + GPU-DRIVER  (Win32 · Linux · macOS) + (Vulkan 1.4 · D3D12 · Metal · WebGPU · Level-Zero)
         ‼ Apocky primary : Win11 + Intel Arc A770 (Vulkan 1.4.333 driver 32.0.101.8629 verified) ‼

    L1 · CSSL-RT runtime  (compiler-rs/crates/cssl-rt)
         C-ABI heap · IO · panic-hook · exit · audit-bus · telemetry-ring · sentinel-bytes · last-error
         platform sub-layers : host_window · host_gpu · host_input · host_audio · host_net · host_fs · host_time · host_thread · host_xr

    L2 · CSSL-stdlib  (stdlib/)
         pure CSSL source · 14 modules · compiles via csslc to native objects ; FFI auto-linked to L1
         exposes : Vec · String · Option · Result · iter · fs · gpu · window · input · audio · time · thread · net · omega

    L3 · SUBSTRATE  (compiler-rs/crates/cssl-substrate-*)
         OmegaTensor H1 · omega_step H2 (13-phase) · projections H3 · save H5 · prime-directive H6
         KAN runtime + Φ-pattern-pool · OmegaField 72B FieldCell (T11-D144 KEYSTONE)
         deterministic-replay · bit-equal save/load · Σ-mask cell-granularity consent threading

    L4 · GAME / APPLICATION  (engine/ + loa-game + cssl-host-* game-systems)
         engine/main.cssl · run_frame · 144Hz Deadline · forward+ pipeline composer · ECS · scene-graph
         loa-game scaffold · per-Q-A..Q-LL spec-hole fills awaiting Apocky direction
         signature-rendering 6 novelty-paths (V.1..V.6) per spec/32 · DEMOTED-TO-OPTIONAL post pivot
  ⟧

§I COMPILER-PIPELINE · source.cssl → executable
  ⟦
    .cssl source
      → cssl-lex (tokens)
      → cssl-parse (AST)
      → cssl-hir (typed · elaborated · IFC-labeled · cap-annotated · effect-rowed)
      → cssl-mir (MLIR cssl-dialect · monomorphic · structured-CFG-only)
        ↳ passes : monomorph · macro-expand · @staged partial-eval · AD source-to-source ·
                   Jet expansion · IFC-check + declassification · evidence-passing transform ·
                   linear×handler one-shot · SMT-discharge · telemetry-probe insert ·
                   structured-CFG validation (CFG0001..CFG0010 stable diag-codes per spec/02)
      → cssl-lir (target-specific)
        ↳ CPU : LLVM-dialect → cranelift-object (stage-0 default · BLOCKER : verifier-errors on 12 new files)
        ↳ CPU : owned-x86-64 (stage-1+ · cssl-cgen-cpu-x64 · ≤ 15K LOC self-hosted target)
        ↳ GPU : spirv-dialect → rspirv (stage-0) | owned-emitter (stage-1+ · ≤ 5K LOC target)
        ↳ GPU : DXIL via dxc subproc (stage-0) | owned-DXIL-emitter (stage-2)
        ↳ GPU : MSL via spirv-cross (stage-0) | owned-MSL-emitter (stage-2)
        ↳ GPU : WGSL via Tint (stage-0) | owned-WGSL-emitter (stage-2)
      → object files (.o / .obj / .mach-o)
      → csslc-linker (rustc-driven currently · WinMain bug FIXED 2026-05-03 commit 19d192a)
      → fat-binary .exe / .so / .dylib
      → runtime loader (libcssl-rt) selects per-platform GPU blob at-launch

    pipeline-status @ 2026-05-18 :
      ✓ stdlib + engine 12 files parse-clean (csslc check)
      ✓ stdlib + engine 12 files type-check + HIR-lower
      ✓ stdlib + engine 12 files MIR-lower (cssl-mir succeeds)
      ✗ stdlib + engine 12 files object-emit (cranelift verifier rejects fn ns_per_sec · gap per spec/55)
      ✗ end-to-end visible-window @ 1440p (machinery present in cssl-host-window · fs_trace not firing post-WinMain-fix)
      ✓ examples/test_visible_window.exe runs 5+ seconds via pump_n loop (post 19d192a · genuine entry-pivot)
  ⟧

