§I FAILURE-MODES
  ⟦
    FM.01 · scenario : this snapshot drifts stale within 1-2 sessions (repo evolves fast per spec/58 measured velocity)
            detection : LIFECYCLE-HISTORY trailer ; CROSS-REFERENCE-INDEX missing newly-added spec numbers
            mitigation : re-snapshot on cadence ; treat this spec as 2026-05-18 baseline ; refresh on any new
                         {strategy + pivot + correctness} spec admission

    FM.02 · scenario : cross-reference set claims a spec exists when it has been deleted/renamed
            detection : ASSERT.09 fails (cross-reference set claims coverage of N specs but file-system has M ≠ N)
            mitigation : re-glob specs/ before any consequent action; treat this snapshot's set as best-effort

    FM.03 · scenario : strategic-posture summary mis-states Apocky's actual current direction
            detection : Apocky directive on any work-day diverges from {α · β · γ · δ} as described
            mitigation : Apocky directive is canonical · this spec amends or supersedes on conflict

    FM.04 · scenario : audit agent missed a load-bearing spec (false-completeness)
            detection : new agent finds spec N that ought to have been in CROSS-REFERENCE-INDEX but isn't
            mitigation : append entry · cross-reference index is amendable in-place
